Privacy Policy
Last updated: Oct 1, 2026
TimePhotos respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how your information is handled when you use the app.

Information We Collect
TimePhotos does not collect personal data from users. All notes and settings are stored locally on your device and are not accessible to us.
If you choose to enable notifications, they are managed entirely by the operating system. The app does not track or store notification usage.

Data Usage
Your data is used only to provide the core functionality of the app, such as creating, displaying, and organizing notes. 
We do not analyze, sell, share, or track your data.

Data Sharing
We do not share your data with third parties.

Purchases
In-app purchases and subscriptions are processed securely by Apple through the App Store. We do not receive or store your payment information.

Children’s Privacy
The app is not intended for children under the age of 13 and does not knowingly collect personal information from children.

Changes to This Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page.

Contact
